      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1771451836,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Sure, use decryption key `e1:4b:96:f0:37:a2:dc:51:25:ff:9b:81:21:28:fd:44` with key index 5.\n\nNote: I think the device responding with the NA should copy the P field, but it does not in this capture. Either way, this demonstrates the dissector in action.\n\nI also just added descriptions for the 2 status codes defined in [section 14.7](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-6lo-multicast-registration-16#name-new-address-registration-op).\n\n[6lowpan-mc-reg.pcapng](/uploads/a6540997d978e867cba871842f84bfe9/6lowpan-mc-reg-2.pcapng)",
          "author": {
            "id": 10365825,
            "username": "MathisMARION",
